OL,3,CMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Cfollowing death of 45-year-old man
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched following the death of a man
OL,8,Fin Southampton.
OL,10,FPolice were called at 4:21am yesterday
OL,11,Fmorning (Sunday 9 August) to a report
OL,12,Fthat a man had been assaulted at an
OL,13,Faddress on Weston Lane, Southampton.
OL,15,FOfficers attended, and a 45-year-old
OL,16,Fman from Southampton was declared
OL,17,Fdeceased at the scene.
OL,19,FHis next of kin has been informed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/2
