OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786384107
OL,3,CMurder investigation launched
OL,4,Cfollowing death of 45-year-old man
OL,6,FPolice say a 23-year-old woman from
OL,7,FBournemouth and a 54-year-old man from
OL,8,FSouthampton were located nearby and
OL,9,Farrested on suspicion of murder.
OL,11,FThey remain in custody.
OL,13,FThe investigation into the incident is
OL,14,Fongoing, and officers will be carrying
OL,15,Fout further enquiries in the area.
